OVED|SAVINGS_RESIDUALS_NOT_CLOSED","claim_present":"no","claim_record_errors":"","decision_origin":"inherited_legacy_v2","exhausted_steps":"","instrument_id":"EO:12442","provisional_status":"no","ready_for_human_review":"no","ready_tier":"","step_clause_inventory":"open","step_counterevidence":"done","step_ending_or_current_basis":"open","step_opus_media":"n/a","step_original_text":"done","step_provisional_status":"done","step_savings_residuals":"open","step_shared_sources":"n/a","steps_applicable":"6","steps_done":"3"},"readiness_blockers":[],"schema":"eo-case-bundle/v1","status":"no","text_pointers":[{"first_1500_characters":"Executive Order 12442 of September 21, 1983\nPresidential Commission on Indian Reservation Economies\nBy the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and laws of the \nUnited States of America, including the Federal Advisory Committee Act, as \namended (5 U.S.C. App. I), it is hereby ordered as follows:\nSection 1. Section 2(d) of Executive Order No. 12401 'is hereby amended to \nprovide as follows:\n“The Commission shall submit its final report to the President and the \nSecretary of the Interior by November 30,1984.”.\nSec. 2. Section 4(b) of Executive Order No. 12401 is hereby amended to \nprovide as follows:\n“The Commission shall, unless sooner extended, terminate 30 days after it \ntransmits its final report to the President.”.\nTHE WHITE HOUSE, \nSep te m b e r 21, 1983.\n[FR D oc. 83-2 8 2 4 2  \nFiled 9 -2 2 -8 3 ; 11:28 am ]","path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/texts/cd-job-fr-originals-12442-5d4fc66a91.txt","sha256":"b32d695cd05210d266f628d23a9d7c8d67715fb5f8ea1f5eeae56ee15e92a44d","source":{"line":2996,"path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"95a2d3562aaeb506b3c3d891be70e80a699b71902ce65c80f066e04b5a1f5424"}},{"first_1500_characters":"Instrument: EO:12442\nSource: https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-09-23/pdf/FR-1983-09-23.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: 5d4fc66a911d126d0ed4ddf1450cb817ed32868181dbe2c4c52cf0902db67153\nLocation: 48 FR 43283, PDF pages 9-9 (confidence high)\nMachine-extracted text layer of the official PDF (OCR for 1936-1994 scans). May contain recognition errors and parts of neighbouring documents on the same pages. Not an authenticated transcription: check the PDF pages.\n\n=== PDF page 9 of 400 ===\n43283\nFederal Register \nV ol. 48, No. 186 \nFriday, September 23, 1983\nPresidential Documents\nTitle 3 —\nThe President\nExecutive Order 12442 of September 21, 1983\nPresidential Commission on Indian Reservation Economies\nBy the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and laws of the \nUnited States of America, including the Federal Advisory Committee Act, as \namended (5 U.S.C. App. I), it is hereby ordered as follows:\nSection 1. Section 2(d) of Executive Order No. 12401 'is hereby amended to \nprovide as follows:\n“The Commission shall submit its final report to the President and the \nSecretary of the Interior by November 30,1984.”.\nSec. 2. Section 4(b) of Executive Order No. 12401 is hereby amended to \nprovide as follows:\n“The Commission shall, unless sooner extended, terminate 30 days after it \ntransmits its final report to the President.”.\nTHE WHITE HOUSE, \nSep te m b e r 21, 1983.\n[FR D oc. 83-2 8 2 4 2  \nFiled 9 -2 2 -8 3 ; 11:28 am ] \nBilling c o d e  31 9 5 -0 1 -M\n","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_12442.txt","sha256":"d26d54c1b6a974f088cb9fe49b88d51057ee780c9f46d84d9ae2cbd3adf5c557","source":{"line":1798,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"2047aa60674c6a146a3b24c52424e9f9e93404a2ea012b8ba69c57efd6374e4b"}}]}
